### Option 3: Full 360° Walkable 3D Gaussian Splatting (AI World Generators)
If you want to walk *behind* the trees or look around corners (inpainting unseen geometry beyond the camera’s field of view):
- **World Labs (Marble)**: Upload this single photo to generate a walkable **3D Gaussian Splat** environment with synthesized out-of-frame geometry.
- **Apple ml-sharp / Depth Pro** (open-source on GitHub): Converts a single photograph into a photorealistic 3D Gaussian Splat (`.ply`) in under a second on a local GPU.
